|~ `::null`, the kind of the absent value, and what is declared under
   it: its constructor and its refusal, and the soft read of it.
   The decisions it exists for: [D114]. ~|

:null
  |~~ Null is the absence of a value, the one value of its kind. It
      stands where a part is missing: `query` reads a part softly and
      answers null where there is none, `{:a 1} | query /b` answering
      `null`, a JSON `null` reads as it, and `coalesce` puts a fallback
      in its place, `{:a 1} | query /b | coalesce 0` answering `0`.

      It is written `null`, and `::null#null` is the same value. It
      ranks first in the one order, before every boolean, and JSON
      writes it as `null`. `get /b` reads strictly: a missing part is a
      failure there, never null, so a misspelled field is
      found where it is read.
      ::snippet~(::null | manifest) lists its words.
      ::link~(::any/coalesce | doc) ::link~(::path | doc)
      ::link~(::qlang/values | doc)
  ~~|
  ::kind
    | wraps |~~ Null, read as itself. ~~|
    | throws :PayloadNotNullError
        |~~ `::null` reads its payload as null; a payload of another kind
            is refused.
        ~~|
    | proves :isNull |~~ Null is of `::null`. ~~| ~(null | type | eq ::null)
    | proves :buildsNull
        |~~ The constructor of null answers null. ~~|
        ~(::null#null | eq null)
    | proves :PayloadNotNullError/refusesANumber
        |~~ A number payload is refused. ~~|
        ~(::null#1 !| get [~(type) /actualType] | eq [::null/PayloadNotNullError ::number])
    | impl ::builtin{}

:null/toKeyword
  |~~ Answers `:null`, the key `groupBy` files an absent field under,
      `groupBy ~(query /country)`. Null has no string: a field that may be
      absent is given a text by `coalesce`.
      ::link~(::vec/groupBy | doc) ::link~(::any/coalesce | doc)
  ~~|
  ::fn
    | returns |~~ `:null`. ~~| ::keyword
    | proves :readsTheKeyGroupByFiledItUnder
        |~~ Null turns into the key `groupBy` files an absent field under.
        ~~|
        ~([{:c "a"} {}] | groupBy ~(query /c) | query (null | toKeyword) | eq [{}])
    | impl ::builtin{}

